  "brief": {
    "application": "Use AWS for this synthetic architecture qualification. Triage synthetic security alerts using approved logs and asset context. Include ingestion, redaction, evidence retrieval, AI triage, an analyst queue and an auditable response proposal. Do not isolate hosts, disable users or execute payloads automatically. Draw the complete end-to-end architecture with concrete service choices and connected flows. Explain the first local test, distinguish mocked model behavior from actual model validation, and ask one useful missing-decision question. Do not reduce this application to storage to satisfy generator coverage. Do not invent successful deployment or approved region/account access.",
    "cloud": "AWS"
  },
